Sagha&#xef; &#xa0;A, Hallin &#xa0;S. Diversity and ecology of NrfA-dependent ammonifying microorganisms. <i>Trends Microbiol</i> &#xa0;2024;32:602&#x2013;13. 10.1016/j.tim.2024.02.007
